    "about": "GridCraft only. Change the inputs in Write inputs (machine price, cups a week, what the café charges) and the workbook works out how many months until a home espresso machine pays for itself, charts café against home spending over two years, and writes a PDF, a CSV and the break-even month as JSON.",
